---
layout: base.njk
title: AI 小作品
permalink: /works/
---
{% import "cards.njk" as c %}
<section class="page-head">
  <h1>AI 小作品</h1>
  <p class="lead">用 AI 做的各種小東西：圖像、文字、互動小工具。</p>
  {{ c.filters("workGrid", collections.works | uniq("kind")) }}
</section>
<div class="grid" id="workGrid">
  {% for w in collections.works %}{{ c.card(w, [w.data.kind, w.data.year]) }}{% endfor %}
</div>
{% if not collections.works.length %}<p class="empty list-page">AI 小作品製作中，敬請期待。</p>{% endif %}
